<title>NEW ZEALAND: Lyttelton Port half-yr profit up 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Lyttelton Port half-yr profit up 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr to December 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  5.61 vs 4.62</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    5.5 vs 4.6</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    2.5 vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			     24.59 vs 23.30</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 8.20 vs 6.93</p>
<p>    Tax				     2.60 vs 2.31</p>
<p>Shares outstanding (million)  101.52 vs same  </p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date March 31</p>
<p>Reg date March 21</p>
<p>Note - Lyttelton Port Ltd operates the Lyttelton Port.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
